## ⚠️ Data Limitation

Budget-versus-actual variance analysis requires budget targets. If the source dataset does not contain budget values, a separate budget dataset or clearly labeled assumptions must be added. Scenario results are estimates, not actual financial outcomes.

## 🏁 Conclusion

This project demonstrates how Power BI, DAX, and financial modeling can transform financial data into interactive visual insights. The dashboard is designed to help users understand revenue performance, cost behavior, profitability, and potential business scenarios.

